  <!-- EN: fragile pain threshold -->
  <RK_Gene_FragilePain.label>易痛</RK_Gene_FragilePain.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have a lower pain shock threshold and go down more easily from injuries. -->
  <RK_Gene_FragilePain.description>基因擁有者疼痛休克閾值較低，受傷後比正常人更容易倒地。</RK_Gene_FragilePain.description>
  <!-- EN: fragile -->
